# Security And No-Claim Proof

App-plan WP12 preserves these boundaries:

- running app evidence is not foreground proof;
- foreground evidence is not content knowledge;
- inventory and launcher evidence are not usage;
- AI cannot directly enforce;
- manual-required states cannot call adapters;
- raw private paths are not surfaced in UI by this workpack;
- portal refresh cannot create app duration;
- broad app blocking remains manual-required/not-claimed.

The shared app/game WP13 proof contains the concrete TypeScript and Rust tests.
